138	  /// Cycle key focus to the next/previous app window — the "Move focus to next window" shortcut
139	  /// (⌘` forward, ⇧⌘` backward), driven by the `AppDelegate` key monitor because the focused
140	  /// terminal surface otherwise swallows the backtick as input. Cycles every workroom window plus
